Error [jet.UseWhileWriteActive]: `total` is changed by a stored lambda that holds its own copy, so it can't be used here
  --> Tests/UI/lambda_mut_borrow_conflict.jet:6:5
    |
  6 |     total += 1
    |     ^^^^^
 Why: A stored lambda owns its captures: its writes land on its copy of `total` and never reach `total` itself
 Fix: Call the lambda only where it is bound so it borrows `total`, or keep the value in a `Shared` or `Cell` the lambda and this code both reach
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0204
